mode: "100644"
text: "# Photograph sources\n\nBoth photographs are bundled locally. Their Wikimedia Commons file pages\nidentify them as dedicated under [CC0 1.0](https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).\nThey are not covered by the Stageshow source-code MIT license.\n\n| Local file | Original and author | Local changes |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `fuji.jpg` | [Fuji Kawaguchi 465.JPG](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fuji_Kawaguchi_465.JPG), Marion & Christoph Aistleitner | Cropped to a 2:1 view of the mountain and lake, resized to 640 × 320, and JPEG-compressed. |\n| `kawaguchiko.jpg` | [Kawaguchiko, Part III - Kawaguchiko6782.jpg](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kawaguchiko,_Part_III_-_Kawaguchiko6782.jpg), lumoplank | Resized to 440 × 309 and JPEG-compressed. |\n\nThe example also displays these files through CSS crops and filters for\nillustrative search-result thumbnails; those thumbnails do not depict every\nplace named in the mocked search results.\n\nSource and CC0 status verified against the Commons file pages on 2026-10-25.\nThe local images matched the recorded crop/resize operations byte for byte.\n"
